{
  "name": "@godcreator/gwb-shell",
  "version": "0.13.0",
  "author": {
    "name": "godcreator"
  },
  "description": "外壳：内核页面根的唯一入口——窗格容器与窗格注册、开窗格、布局落盘与多桌面、整页重载、状态栏报版本；浏览器半与样式表的地址由 node 半算成 file:// 报给页面。服务 gwbShell；skill 0 份；命令 17 条。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "dist/index.js",
  "types": "dist/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./dist/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "src"
  ],
  "//gwb": "**整段没有**:这个件是外壳,而「我是外壳」这件事靠 node 半调 kernel.setShell 说,不靠包清单。清单里只剩共享包的 gwb.shared 有人读（内核扫它拼 importmap），这个件不是共享包",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json && node build.ts && tailwindcss -i src/client/styles.css -o dist/style.css",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json && tsc --noEmit -p src/client/tsconfig.json",
    "//prepublishOnly": "发版前强制构建一次。pnpm check 只跑 typecheck/lint/test **不构建**,少了这条就会把上一版的 dist 原样发出去——而且是静默的",
    "prepublishOnly": "pnpm build"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@godcreator/gwb-commands": "^0.4.3",
    "@godcreator/gwb-data": "^0.1.3",
    "@godcreator/gwb-plugin-api": "^0.1.2",
    "@godcreator/gwb-shared-react": "^0.1.1",
    "@godcreator/gwb-tokens": "^0.1.4",
    "cordis": "^4.0.0-rc.9"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@godcreator/gwb-commands": "0.4.3",
    "@godcreator/gwb-data": "0.1.3",
    "@godcreator/gwb-plugin-api": "0.1.2",
    "@godcreator/gwb-repo-kit": "0.2.3",
    "@godcreator/gwb-shared-react": "workspace:*",
    "@godcreator/gwb-tokens": "workspace:*",
    "@tailwindcss/cli": "^4.3.0",
    "@tailwindcss/node": "^4.3.0",
    "@types/node": "^24.0.0",
    "@types/react": "19.2.18",
    "@types/react-dom": "19.2.5",
    "class-variance-authority": "^0.7.1",
    "cn": "^0.2.5",
    "cordis": "4.0.0-rc.9",
    "dockview-react": "8.2.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.27.7",
    "lucide-react": "^1.41.0",
    "postcss": "^8.5.28",
    "radix-ui": "^1.6.7",
    "react": "19.2.8",
    "react-dom": "19.2.8",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.3.0",
    "tw-animate-css": "^1.4.0",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://git.tianshen02.online:28377/godcreator/gwb-ui-plugins.git"
  },
  "keywords": ["gwb", "gwb-plugin"]
}
